This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Shard e of review-shard-merge runs unit canon: merge-review-shards.sh --check-serial in place over mktemp worlds whose role and gate files are copies of the located ones (install.sh copies team-roles verbatim). The merge resolves its siblings from its own path, and every mutant is skipped on a consumer anyway. A consumer runs the shipped shards a-d, which keep the located recorder hook, seal and wait-for-deliverable, and the arms that read the installed role, gate and QA files.
